Q: In a google sheets query, replace all diacritic caracters with a formula A: <p>try:</p>
<pre><code>=LET(a; repl_table!A2:İNDİS(repl_table!A:A; XMATCH(;-(repl_table!A:A=&quot;&quot;);;-1)); 
 BYROW( C2:İNDİS(C:C; XMATCH(;-(C:C=&quot;&quot;);;-1));
 LAMBDA(b; TNÉV(REDUCE(b; SEQUENCE(LINS(a)); 
 LAMBDA(c; d; REGEXREPLACE(c; İNDİS(a;d); СМЕЩ(a;d-1;1;1)
</code></pre>
<p><a href="https://i.sstatic.net/Jp8wFqo2.png" rel="nofollow noreferrer"><img src="https://i.sstatic.net/Jp8wFqo2.png" alt="enter image description here" /></a></p>

Q: scrollTo() function does nothing A: <h1>Solved. This is what had to be done:</h1>
<pre><code>document.getElementsByTagName('body')[0].style.display = &quot;block&quot;;
</code></pre>
<p>For whatever reason, changing the display to &quot;block&quot; enabled the scrolling using the given code:</p>
<pre><code>window.scrollTo(0,document.body.scrollHeight);
</code></pre>
